<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Knoodle — Learn it. Know it. Knoodle it.</title>
  
  <!-- Your Icon -->
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="icon.png">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="icon.png">

  <style>
    :root {
      --paper: #fef8f0;
      --card: #fffdf8;
      --ink: #4a3f38;
      --muted: #9b8877;
      --line: #f0e4d4;
      --accent: #dd7860;
      --accent-dark: #b85a44;
      --green: #7fb069;
      --amber: #e8b04b;
      --red: #d96a5c;
      --peach: #fce8dc;
      --shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(200, 140, 100, 0.08);
      --radius-a: 16px 20px 18px 22px;
      --radius-b: 20px 16px 22px 18px;
      --radius-c: 18px 22px 16px 20px;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--paper);
      color: var(--ink);
      font: 16px/1.55 system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      background-image: 
        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 10%, rgba(221, 120, 96, 0.04) 0, transparent 40%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 80%, rgba(127, 176, 105, 0.04) 0, transparent 40%),
        linear-gradient(rgba(177, 202, 210, 0.08) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: auto, auto, 100% 34px;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    h1, h2, h3 {
      font-family: ui-rounded, "SF Pro Rounded", "Segoe UI Rounded", system-ui, sans-serif;
      letter-spacing: -0.4px;
    }

    button {
      font: inherit;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    /* Navbar */
    .topbar {
      height: 70px;
      padding: 0 max(20px, calc((100vw - 920px) / 2));
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      background: rgba(254, 248, 240, 0.94);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 5;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 11px;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 850;
      font-size: 22px;
      text-decoration: none;
      letter-spacing: -0.8px;
      font-family: ui-rounded, system-ui, sans-serif;
    }

    .brand-mascot {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      object-fit: contain;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .beta-pill {
      font-size: 11.5px;
      color: var(--accent-dark);
      border: 1.5px dashed #e8c9b8;
      border-radius: 99px;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      background: var(--peach);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.2px;
    }

    /* Main Container */
    .app {
      max-width: 920px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 40px 20px 60px;
    }

    /* Hero Section */
    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fce8dc 0%, #fdf1e6 100%);
      border: 1.5px solid #f0d5c0;
      border-radius: var(--radius-a);
      padding: 50px 30px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .hero::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      right: -30px;
      bottom: -40px;
      width: 180px;
      height: 180px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
      z-index: 0;
    }

    .hero > * {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 42px);
      line-height: 1.1;
      color: #5c3a2a;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    .hero p {
      margin: 16px 0 28px;
      color: #8b6d5c;
      font-size: 16px;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }

    .cta-button {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #fff;
      border: none;
      padding: 15px 32px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(221, 120, 96, 0.3);
      transition: all 0.2s;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .cta-button:hover {
      background: var(--accent-dark);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(221, 120, 96, 0.4);
    }

    /* Features Grid */
    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 26px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: #3c3028;
    }

    .section-sub {
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 50px;
    }

    .feature-card {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1.5px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius-c);
      padding: 24px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      transition: transform 0.2s;
    }

    .feature-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }

    .feature-icon {
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--peach);
      width: 50px;
      height: 50px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border: 1.5px dashed #e8c9b8;
    }

    .feature-card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #3c3028;
    }

    .feature-card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* Vision Section */
    .vision-panel {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1.5px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius-b);
      padding: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .vision-panel h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 22px;
      color: #3c3028;
    }

    .vision-panel p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      border-top: 1.5px dashed var(--line);
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    footer a {
      color: var(--accent);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    footer a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline wavy 1.5px;
    }

    /* Toast */
    .toast {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 20px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, 20px);
      background: #3c3028;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      font-size: 14px;
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: 0.25s;
      z-index: 10;
      max-width: 90vw;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .toast.show {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translate(-50%, 0);
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .app {
        padding: 20px 14px 40px;
      }
      .hero {
        padding: 36px 20px;
      }
      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 32px;
      }
      .vision-panel {
        padding: 24px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Navbar -->
  <header class="topbar">
    <a class="brand" href="#">
      <!-- Your Icon -->
      <img class="brand-mascot" src="icon.png" alt="Knoodle Logo">
      <span>Knoodle</span>
    </a>
    <span class="beta-pill">Coming Soon</span>
  </header>

  <main class="app">
    
    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>Learn it. Know it.<br>Knoodle it.</h1>
      <p>A universal, open-source learning platform. Built to help you actually remember what you study — not just collect flashcards.</p>
      
      <!-- Call to action (Triggers toast for now) -->
      <button class="cta-button" id="waitlist-btn">
        Join the Beta Waitlist
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </button>
    </section>

    <!-- Features -->
    <h2 class="section-title">One platform. Any knowledge.</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Knoodle is designed as a modular system. The language module is in development now, with more subjects to follow.</p>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🗣️</div>
        <h3>Languages</h3>
        <p>Vocabulary, phrases, and grammar. Practice production and recall, not just recognition.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🧪</div>
        <h3>Science & Experiments</h3>
        <p>Hypotheses, processes, and conclusions. Perfect for lab prep and understanding the "why".</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">💻</div>
        <h3>Coding & Tech</h3>
        <p>Syntax, patterns, algorithms, and terminology. Active recall for technical knowledge.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">📚</div>
        <h3>School Subjects</h3>
        <p>Dates, definitions, formulas, and history. Turn any worksheet or note into a learnable deck.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Vision / About -->
    <div class="vision-panel">
      <h2>Quality over quantity.</h2>
      <p>Most study apps count what you've flipped. Knoodle counts what you actually <em>know</em>. We track confidence, separate "shaky" memory from solid knowledge, and build your progress around honest numbers.</p>
      
      <h2 style="margin-top: 10px;">Open Source, Real Brand.</h2>
      <p>Knoodle is being built in the open by Kaier. The core learning engine is open-source (BSD 3-Clause), while the brand and future hosted app remain private. It's a student project growing into something real.</p>
    </div>

  </main>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer>
    <div>&copy; 2026 Kaier Chang. All rights reserved.</div>
    <div>
      Released under the <a href="LICENSE" target="_blank">BSD 3-Clause License</a>. 
      Knoodle, the mascot, and logo are trademarks — <a href="TRADEMARKS.md" target="_blank">see here</a>.
    </div>
  </footer>

  <!-- Toast for Waitlist -->
  <div id="toast" class="toast"></div>

  <script>
    // Simple logic to handle the Waitlist button without backend
    const waitlistBtn = document.getElementById('waitlist-btn');
    const toast = document.getElementById('toast');
    let toastTimer;

    waitlistBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      toast.textContent = "The beta is currently private. Follow the GitHub repo for updates!";
      toast.classList.add('show');
      
      clearTimeout(toastTimer);
      toastTimer = setTimeout(() => {
        toast.classList.remove('show');
      }, 3500);
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>